<title>FRANCE: Paris May 97 import air cargo traffic up 4.3pct.</title>
<headline>Paris May 97 import air cargo traffic up 4.3pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paris-CDG and Orly airports handled 48,569 tonnes of import cargo in May, up 4.3 percent on the same month last year, Aeroports de Paris (ADP), figures show.</p>
<p>The Paris airports' May 1997 import traffic, in tonnes, by region, with percentage change on May 1996, was as follows:</p>
<p>  Domestic		3,235 tonnes	down 18.6 percent</p>
<p>  European Union	6,111		 up    9.7</p>
<p>  Non-EU Europe	 1,223		 up   11.5</p>
<p>  North Africa	  1,061		 up   37.7</p>
<p>  Sub-Saharan Africa  3,711		 down  1.3</p>
<p>  North America	13,560		 up    5.3</p>
<p>  French territories  2,259		 up    1.0</p>
<p>  Latin America	 2,578		 up    2.4</p>
<p>  Middle East	   4,800		 up    2.6</p>
<p>  Far East	     10,031		 up   10.4</p>
<p>  Total		  48,569		 up    4.3</p>
</text>
